      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/d/97f17d/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2014-05-04T14:31:26.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>This is another of those quick ruling type questions. Fighting the Chairman. Expatriette has Hairtrigger Reflexes in play, there is a Crooked Cop in play and an underboss enters play. Can Expt ding him? I've been playing conservative and saying no, but one could argue that Hairtrigger Reflexes hits the underboss AS it is ENTERING play, while the Crooked Cop can only protect the boss once it is IN play. &nbsp;FWIW Hairtrigger Reflexes is older than the Crooked Cop.&nbsp;</p>",
      "post_number": 1,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:41:17.499Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
      "quote_count": 0,
      "incoming_link_count": 1,
      "reads": 0,
      "readers_count": 0,
