      "username": "Powerhound_2000",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/powerhound_2000/{size}/1859_2.png",
      "created_at": "2014-05-04T14:47:08.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Yes, Hairtrigger reflexes would allow you to hit the underboss, then the crooked cop comes into play, and then Hairtrigger Reflexes would allow you to hit the Crooked Cop. &nbsp; So your hit on the underboss would do full damage in this case. &nbsp;</p>",
