      "can_wiki": false,
      "read": false,
      "user_title": null,
      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "[quote=\"Powerhound_2000\"]\n\nYes, Hairtrigger reflexes would allow you to hit the underboss, then the crooked cop comes into play, and then Hairtrigger Reflexes would allow you to hit the Crooked Cop. &nbsp; So your hit on the underboss would do full damage in this case. &nbsp;\n\n[/quote]\n\n&nbsp;\n\nJust to clarify, the Crooked Cop is already on the table when the new Underboss is played, so it&#39;s not a question of hitting the cop, but whether the cop will protect the underboss. And it looks like not since Expat is hitting the boss during the act of being played.&nbsp;\n",
